      "html": "<div class=\"container-fluid pb-5 hero-header hero-home\">\n        <div class=\"container py-5\">\n            <div class=\"hero-glass row g-3 align-items-center p-4 p-lg-5 mx-0\">\n                <div class=\"col-lg-6 text-center text-lg-start\">\n                    <h1 class=\"display-4 mb-0 animated slideInLeft\">Our Services</h1>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"col-lg-6 animated slideInRight\">\n                    <nav aria-label=\"breadcrumb\">\n                        <ol class=\"breadcrumb justify-content-center justify-content-lg-end mb-0\">\n                            <li class=\"breadcrumb-item\"><a class=\"text-primary\" href=\"/index.html\">Home</a></li>\n                            <li class=\"breadcrumb-item text-secondary active\" aria-current=\"page\">Services</li>\n                        </ol>\n                    </nav>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>"
    },
    {
      "type": "html",
      "html": "<div class=\"container-fluid py-5\">\n        <div class=\"container py-5\">\n            <div class=\"row g-5 align-items-center\">\n                <div class=\"col-lg-5 wow fadeIn\" data-wow-delay=\"0.1s\">\n                    <h2 class=\"h1 mb-5\">What We <span class=\"text-uppercase text-primary bg-light px-2\">Create</span>\n                    </h2>\n                    <p>The Omega Group offers a complete range of interior design and turnkey execution services for\n                        residential and commercial clients. Whether you are furnishing a single room or building a\n                        home from the ground up, our team leads every stage under one roof.</p>\n                    <p class=\"mb-5\">Every engagement is scoped around your space, budget, and timeline, with a\n                        dedicated design lead guiding the project from first consultation to final handover.</p>\n                    <div class=\"d-flex align-items-center bg-light\">\n                        <div class=\"btn-square flex-shrink-0 bg-primary\" style=\"width: 100px; height: 100px;\">\n                            <i class=\"fa fa-phone fa-2x text-white\"></i>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"px-3\">\n                            <h3>+91 981 1001 900</h3>\n                            <span>Call us directly for a complimentary design consultation</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"col-lg-7\">\n                    <div class=\"row g-4\">\n                        <div class=\"col-md-6 wow fadeIn\" data-wow-delay=\"0.2s\">\n                            <div class=\"service-card\">\n                                <div class=\"service-card-img\">\n                                    <img class=\"img-fluid w-100\"\n                                        src=\"/img/service-1.webp\"\n                                        alt=\"Luxury living room interior with custom furnishings by The Omega Group\">\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"service-card-body\">\n                                    <h4>Luxury Home Interiors</h4>\n                                    <p>Complete home interiors designed around your lifestyle — layout,\n                                        lighting, furniture, and finishes planned as one cohesive whole.</p>\n                                    <a href=\"/contact.html\" class=\"service-card-link\">Enquire Now <i\n                                            class=\"bi bi-arrow-right\"></i></a>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"col-md-6 wow fadeIn\" data-wow-delay=\"0.4s\">\n                            <div class=\"service-card\">\n                                <div class=\"service-card-img\">\n                                    <img class=\"img-fluid w-100\"\n                                        src=\"/img/service-2.webp\"\n                                        alt=\"Contemporary apartment living room with a navy sectional sofa styled by The Omega Group\">\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"service-card-body\">\n                                    <h4>Apartment Interiors</h4>\n                                    <p>Space-smart interiors for apartments that make the most of every\n                                        square foot without compromising on style.</p>\n                                    <a href=\"/contact.html\" class=\"service-card-link\">Enquire Now <i\n                                            class=\"bi bi-arrow-right\"></i></a>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"col-md-6 wow fadeIn\" data-wow-delay=\"0.6s\">\n                            <div class=\"service-card\">\n                                <div class=\"service-card-img\">\n                                    <img class=\"img-fluid w-100\"\n                                        src=\"/img/service-3.webp\"\n                                        alt=\"Custom cabinetry and styled reading corner crafted by The Omega Group\">\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"service-card-body\">\n                                    <h4>Bespoke Furniture</h4>\n                                    <p>Custom-made furniture and cabinetry, designed and built to fit your\n                                        exact space, proportions, and material palette.</p>\n                                    <a href=\"/contact.html\" class=\"service-card-link\">Enquire Now <i\n                                            class=\"bi bi-arrow-right\"></i></a>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"col-md-6 wow fadeIn\" data-wow-delay=\"0.8s\">\n                            <div class=\"service-card\">\n                                <div class=\"service-card-img\">\n                                    <img class=\"img-fluid w-100\"\n                                        src=\"/img/project-4.webp\"\n                                        alt=\"Moody, dark-toned villa living room and lounge by The Omega Group\">\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"service-card-body\">\n                                    <h4>Villa Interiors</h4>\n                                    <p>Expansive interiors for independent villas, balancing indoor-outdoor\n                                        flow with refined, liveable luxury.</p>\n                                    <a href=\"/contact.html\" class=\"service-card-link\">Enquire Now <i\n                                            class=\"bi bi-arrow-right\"></i></a>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>"
    },
    {
      "type": "html",
      "html": "<div class=\"container-fluid bg-light py-5\">\n        <div class=\"container py-5\">\n            <div class=\"text-center wow fadeIn\" data-wow-delay=\"0.1s\">\n                <h2 class=\"h1 mb-5\">Additional <span class=\"text-uppercase text-primary bg-light px-2\">Expertise</span>\n                </h2>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"row g-4 text-center\">\n                <div class=\"col-md-6 col-lg-4 wow fadeIn\" data-wow-delay=\"0.1s\">\n                    <div class=\"icon-card\">\n                        <i class=\"fa fa-key fa-3x mb-4\"></i>\n                        <h4>Turnkey Interior Solutions</h4>\n                        <p class=\"mb-0\">One team manages design, procurement, and execution end-to-end, so you deal\n                            with a single point of contact from start to finish.</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"col-md-6 col-lg-4 wow fadeIn\" data-wow-delay=\"0.3s\">\n                    <div class=\"icon-card\">\n                        <i class=\"fa fa-building fa-3x mb-4\"></i>\n                        <h4>Office Interiors</h4>\n                        <p class=\"mb-0\">Workspaces designed to reflect your brand and support how your teams actually\n                            work day to day.</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"col-md-6 col-lg-4 wow fadeIn\" data-wow-delay=\"0.5s\">\n                    <div class=\"icon-card\">\n                        <i class=\"fa fa-store fa-3x mb-4\"></i>\n                        <h4>Commercial Interiors</h4>\n                        <p class=\"mb-0\">Retail, hospitality, and business interiors built to welcome clients and\n                            perform under everyday use.</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"col-md-6 col-lg-4 wow fadeIn\" data-wow-delay=\"0.1s\">\n                    <div class=\"icon-card\">\n                        <i class=\"fa fa-utensils fa-3x mb-4\"></i>\n                        <h4>Modular Kitchens</h4>\n                        <p class=\"mb-0\">Ergonomic, high-durability modular kitchens tailored to your cooking habits\n                            and storage needs.</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"col-md-6 col-lg-4 wow fadeIn\" data-wow-delay=\"0.3s\">\n                    <div class=\"icon-card\">\n                        <i class=\"fa fa-ruler-combined fa-3x mb-4\"></i>\n                        <h4>Space Planning</h4>\n                        <p class=\"mb-0\">Thoughtful layouts that improve flow, light, and function before a single\n                            finish is chosen.</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"col-md-6 col-lg-4 wow fadeIn\" data-wow-delay=\"0.5s\">\n                    <div class=\"icon-card\">\n                        <i class=\"fa fa-palette fa-3x mb-4\"></i>\n                        <h4>Interior Styling</h4>\n                        <p class=\"mb-0\">Curated decor, art, and accessories that bring warmth and personality to a\n                            finished space.</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>"
    },
    {
      "type": "faq",
      "id": "faq-service",
      "items": [
        {
          "question": "What interior design services does The Omega Group offer?",
          "answer": "Full-home, villa, and apartment interiors, modular kitchens, bespoke furniture, and office & commercial interiors — plus turnkey execution, space planning, and interior styling across all of them."
        },
        {
          "question": "Do you design modular kitchens?",
          "answer": "Yes — ergonomic, high-durability modular kitchens tailored to cooking habits and storage needs, designed and installed by our own team."
        },
        {
          "question": "Can you design both residential and commercial spaces?",
          "answer": "Yes — homes, villas, and apartments as well as office and commercial interiors, all under the same turnkey process."
        },
        {
          "question": "Is turnkey execution included in your services?",
          "answer": "Yes — design, procurement, and site execution are managed by one team, so you deal with a single point of contact from start to finish."
        },
        {
          "question": "How do I request a quote?",
          "answerHtml": "Book a complimentary consultation on our <a href=\"/contact.html\">Contact page</a> or call +91 981 1001 900 — we'll scope your project before proposing pricing."
        }
      ],
      "headingHtml": "Frequently Asked <span class=\"text-uppercase text-primary bg-light px-2\">Questions</span>"
    },
    {
      "type": "html",
      "html": "<div class=\"container-xxl pb-5\">\n        <div class=\"container pb-5\">\n            <div class=\"text-center wow fadeIn\" data-wow-delay=\"0.1s\">\n                <h2 class=\"h1 mb-5\">Client <span class=\"text-uppercase text-primary bg-light px-2\">Love</span></h2>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n                <div class=\"col-md-12 col-lg-9\">\n                    <div class=\"owl-carousel testimonial-carousel wow fadeIn\" data-wow-delay=\"0.2s\">\n                        <div class=\"testimonial-item\">\n                            <div class=\"testimonial-text\">\n                                <i class=\"fa fa-quote-left fa-2x mb-4\"></i>\n                                <p>The modular kitchen The Omega Group designed for us is both beautiful and genuinely\n                                    functional. Every drawer and cabinet was planned around how we cook and store\n                                    things.</p>\n                                <h5 class=\"mb-0\">Neha Sharma, Homeowner</h5>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"testimonial-item\">\n                            <div class=\"testimonial-text\">\n                                <i class=\"fa fa-quote-left fa-2x mb-4\"></i>\n                                <p>Our office interiors were completed on schedule without disrupting daily\n                                    operations. The team coordinated every phase around our working hours.</p>\n                                <h5 class=\"mb-0\">Arjun Verma, Facility Manager</h5>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"testimonial-item\">\n                            <div class=\"testimonial-text\">\n                                <i class=\"fa fa-quote-left fa-2x mb-4\"></i>\n                                <p>The bespoke furniture pieces fit our home perfectly, down to the last centimetre.\n                                    It is clear the team measured and planned with real care.</p>\n                                <h5 class=\"mb-0\">Kavita Rao, Villa Owner</h5>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>"
    }
